{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Firebrand detonates once per expiry with its tooltip scaling per stack",
  "contract": [
    "Firebrand, Weapon Engraving: Fire 653210, reads 'When this effect expires, it explodes, dealing",
    "${$m1+$AP*.075+$spfi*.2} Fire damage per stack.' Its effect 0 is a periodic Fire tick of $m1 whose amplitude",
    "equals the 3 sec duration, so it ticks once as the aura expires, and every Fire Engraving talent (Explosive",
    "Runes, Devastating Flames, Forbidden Engraving, Melting Runes) targets 653210's family mask. The #161 script",
    "aura_ascension_runemaster_firebrand also cast the orphaned Fire Engraving damage 653212 once per stack on that",
    "expiry, a second detonation, while the tick had no attack or spell power term. Expected: one 653210 tick per",
    "expiry and no 653212; the tick gains 7.5% of attack power and 20% of Fire spell power, times the caster's",
    "damage-done multiplier of 1.11 at this fixture (runemaster-primordial-salvos), per stack; two stacks deal twice",
    "one stack. Devastating Flames 806993 (SPELLMOD_DOT +20% on 653210) then raises the whole detonation. Attack",
    "Power 980002 (+400) and Drink Fel Infusion 44505 (+2000 spell damage) vary the stats for the native periodic",
    "damage query."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
